lated hereditary coproporphyria\n+is_a: MONDO:0800180 {source=\"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/9703\", source=\"https://clinicalgenome.org/affiliation/40097/\"} ! CPOX-related hepatic porphyria\n relationship: has_material_basis_in_germline_mutation_in http://identifiers.org/hgnc/2321 {source=\"OMIM:618892\"} ! CPOX\n-relationship: RO:0004001 http://identifiers.org/hgnc/2321 {source=\"OMIM:618892\"} ! has material basis in gain of function germline mutation in CPOX\n property_value: curated_content_resource \"https://www.malacards.org/card/harderoporphyria\" xsd:anyURI {source=\"MONDO:MalaCards\"}\n+property_value: IAO:0000233 \"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/9703\" xsd:anyURI\n \n [Term]\n id: MONDO:0030049\n@@ -566369,8 +566384,8 @@ property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator https://orcid.org/0000-0001-520\n \n [Term]\n id: MONDO:0100498\n-name: UROD-related inherited porphyria\n-def: \"Any inherited porphyria in which the cause of the disease is monoallelic or biallelic variants in the UROD gene.\" [https://clinicalgenome.org/affiliation/40097/, MONDO:patterns/disease_series_by_gene]\n+name: UROD-related porphyria\n+def: \"A porphyria caused by monoallelic or biallelic variants in the UROD gene. Monoallelic variants typically contribute to porphyria cutanea tarda in the presence of additional environmental or metabolic factors, whereas biallelic variants cause hepatoerythropoietic porphyria.\" [https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/9703, https://clinicalgenome.org/affiliation/40097/]\n subset: clingen {source=\"MONDO:CLINGEN\"}\n subset: gard_rare {source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\n subset: otar {source=\"MONDO:OTAR\"}\n@@ -566381,6 +566396,7 @@ intersection_of: has_material_basis_in_germline_mutation_in http://identifiers.o\n relationship: curated_content_resource https://search.clinicalgenome.org/kb/conditions/MONDO:0100498 {source=\"MONDO:CLINGEN\"}\n property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432\n property_value: IAO:0000233 \"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/5128\" xsd:anyURI\n+property_value: IAO:0000233 \"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/9703\" xsd:anyURI\n \n [Term]\n id: MONDO:0100499\n@@ -574355,17 +574371,20 @@ property_value: IAO:0000233 \"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/\n \n [Term]\n id: MONDO:0800180\n-name: CPOX-related hereditary coproporphyria\n-def: \"Any inherited porphyria in which the cause of the disease is monoallelic or biallelic variants in the CPOX gene.\" [https://clinicalgenome.org/affiliation/40097/, https://clinicalgenome.org/working-groups/clinical-domain/inborn-errors-of-metabolism/]\n-comment: Per criteria outlined by the ClinGen Lumping and Splitting Working Group, the molecular mechanism (CPOX loss-of-function) was found to be consistent between the harderoporphyria cases and hereditary coproporphyria cases. In addition, the phenotypic differences between the biallelic and monoallelic cases appeared to represent a single spectrum of disease. Therefore, cases caused by inherited CPOX variants have been lumped into a single disease entity referred to as CPOX-related hereditary coproporphyria, with a semidominant mode of inheritance.\n+name: CPOX-related hepatic porphyria\n+def: \"A semidominant hepatic porphyria caused by monoallelic or biallelic variants in the CPOX gene. Monoallelic variants typically cause hereditary coproporphyria, whereas biallelic variants can cause the more severe harderoporphyria phenotype.\" [https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/9703, https://clinicalgenome.org/affiliation/40097/]\n+comment: Per criteria outlined by the ClinGen Lumping and Splitting Working Group, the molecular mechanism is consistent across hereditary coproporphyria and harderoporphyria, and the phenotypic differences between monoallelic and biallelic cases are treated as a semidominant disease spectrum.\n subset: clingen {source=\"MONDO:CLINGEN\"}\n subset: gard_rare {source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\n subset: otar {source=\"MONDO:OTAR\"}\n subset: rare\n-is_a: MONDO:0019142 {source=\"https://clinicalgenome.org/affiliation/40097/\", source=\"https://clinicalgenome.org/working-groups/clinical-domain/inborn-errors-of-metabolism/\"} ! inherited porphyria\n+is_a: MONDO:0002520 {source=\"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/9703\", source=\"https://clinicalgenome.org/affiliation/40097/\"} ! hepatic porphyria\n+intersection_of: MONDO:0002520 ! hepatic porphyria\n+intersection_of: has_material_basis_in_germline_mutation_in http://identifiers.org/hgnc/2321 ! CPOX\n relationship: curated_content_resource https://search.clinicalgenome.org/kb/conditions/MONDO:0800180 {source=\"MONDO:CLINGEN\"}\n-relationship: RO:0004001 http://identifiers.org/hgnc/2321 {source=\"https://clinicalgenome.org/affiliation/40097/\", source=\"https://clinicalgenome.org/working-groups/clinical-domain/inborn-errors-of-metabolism/\"} ! has material basis in gain of function germline mutation in CPOX\n+relationship: has_material_basis_in_germline_mutation_in http://identifiers.org/hgnc/2321 {source=\"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/9703\", source=\"https://clinicalgenome.org/affiliation/40097/\"} ! CPOX\n property_value: IAO:0000233 \"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/5474\" xsd:anyURI\n+property_value: IAO:0000233 \"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/9703\" xsd:anyURI\n \n [Term]\n id: MONDO:0800181\n@@ -585101,10 +585120,12 @@ xref: OMIM:620483 {source=\"MONDO:equivalentTo\"}\n xref: UMLS:C5882681 {source=\"MONDO:equivalentTo\", source=\"MONDO:MEDGEN\", source=\"MEDGEN:1849794\"}\n is_a: MONDO:0003847 {source=\"OMIM:620483\"} ! hereditary disease\n is_a: MONDO:0008297 {source=\"OMIM:176200\", source=\"OMIM:620483\"} ! variegate porphyria\n+is_a: MONDO:7770005 {source=\"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/9703\"} ! PPOX-related hepatic porphyria\n relationship: excluded_from_qc_check http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/mondo/sparql/qc/general/qc-single-child.sparql\n relationship: excluded_from_qc_check http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/mondo/sparql/qc/mondo/qc-omim-subsumption.sparql\n relationship: has_material_basis_in_germline_mutation_in http://identifiers.org/hgnc/9280 {source=\"OMIM:620483\"} ! PPOX\n property_value: curated_content_resource \"https://www.malacards.org/card/variegate_porphyria_childhood_onset\" xsd:anyURI {source=\"MONDO:MalaCards\"}\n+property_value: IAO:0000233 \"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/9703\" xsd:anyURI\n \n [Term]\n id: MONDO:0957578\n@@ -587000,8 +587021,10 @@ xref: MEDGEN:1859316 {source=\"MONDO:equivalentTo\", source=\"MONDO:MEDGEN\"}\n xref: OMIM:620704 {source=\"MONDO:equivalentTo\"}\n xref: UMLS:C5935574 {source=\"MONDO:equivalentTo\", source=\"MEDGEN:1859316\", source=\"MONDO:MEDGEN\"}\n is_a: MONDO:0100198 {source=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4142-7153\"} ! Mendelian encephalopathy\n+is_a: MONDO:7770003 {source=\"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/9703\"} ! HMBS-related hepatic porphyria\n relationship: has_material_basis_in_germline_mutation_in http://identifiers.org/hgnc/4982 {source=\"OMIM:620704\"} ! HMBS\n property_value: curated_content_resource \"https://www.malacards.org/card/encephalopathy_porphyria_related\" xsd:anyURI {source=\"MONDO:MalaCards\"}\n+property_value: IAO:0000233 \"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/9703\" xsd:anyURI\n \n [Term]\n id: MONDO:0958226\n@@ -587012,8 +587035,10 @@ xref: MEDGEN:1862491 {source=\"MONDO:equivalentTo\", source=\"MONDO:MEDGEN\"}\n xref: OMIM:620711 {source=\"MONDO:equivalentTo\"}\n xref: UMLS:C5935575 {source=\"MEDGEN:1862491\", source=\"MONDO:equivalentTo\", source=\"MONDO:MEDGEN\"}\n is_a: MONDO:0019046 {source=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4142-7153\"} ! leukodystrophy\n+is_a: MONDO:7770003 {source=\"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/9703\"} ! HMBS-related hepatic porphyria\n relationship: has_material_basis_in_germline_mutation_in http://identifiers.org/hgnc/4982 {source=\"OMIM:620711\"} ! HMBS\n property_value: curated_content_resource \"https://www.malacards.org/card/leukoencephalopathy_porphyria_related\" xsd:anyURI {source=\"MONDO:MalaCards\"}\n+property_value: IAO:0000233 \"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/9703\" xsd:anyURI\n \n [Term]\n id: MONDO:0958227\n@@ -621766,6 +621791,44 @@ is_a: MONDO:0005451 {source=\"PMID:38849953\"} ! eating disorder\n property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator https://orcid.org/0000-0003-3311-7320\n property_value: IAO:0000233 \"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/9408\" xsd:anyURI\n \n+[Term]\n+id: MONDO:7770003\n+name: HMBS-related hepatic porphyria\n+def: \"A semidominant hepatic porphyria caused by monoallelic or biallelic variants in the HMBS gene. Monoallelic variants typically cause acute intermittent porphyria with neurovisceral attacks, whereas biallelic variants can cause a severe childhood-onset neurologic phenotype that may include developmental abnormalities, ataxia, dysarthria, leukoencephalopathy, cataracts, and optic nerve hypoplasia.\" [https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/9703, https://clinicalgenome.org/affiliation/40097/]\n+subset: clingen {source=\"MONDO:CLINGEN\"}\n+subset: rare\n+is_a: MONDO:0002520 {source=\"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/9703\", source=\"https://clinicalgenome.org/affiliation/40097/\"} ! hepatic porphyria\n+intersection_of: MONDO:0002520 ! hepatic porphyria\n+intersection_of: has_material_basis_in_germline_mutation_in http://identifiers.org/hgnc/4982 ! HMBS\n+relationship: has_material_basis_in_germline_mutation_in http://identifiers.org/hgnc/4982 {source=\"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/9703\", source=\"https://clinicalgenome.org/affiliation/40097/\"} ! HMBS\n+property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator doi:10.1186/s13326-024-00320-3\n+property_value: IAO:0000233 \"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/9703\" xsd:anyURI\n+\n+[Term]\n+id: MONDO:7770004\n+name: acute intermittent porphyria nonerythroid variant\n+def: \"An HMBS-related hepatic porphyria caused by variants that affect the erythroid-specific exon 1 or exon 1 to 3 splicing of HMBS, resulting in acute intermittent porphyria with normal erythrocyte hydroxymethylbilane synthase activity.\" [https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/9703, https://clinicalgenome.org/affiliation/40097/]\n+subset: clingen {source=\"MONDO:CLINGEN\"}\n+subset: rare\n+is_a: MONDO:0008294 {source=\"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/9703\"} ! acute intermittent porphyria\n+is_a: MONDO:7770003 {source=\"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/9703\"} ! HMBS-related hepatic porphyria\n+relationship: has_material_basis_in_germline_mutation_in http://identifiers.org/hgnc/4982 {source=\"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/9703\", source=\"https://clinicalgenome.org/affiliation/40097/\"} ! HMBS\n+property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator doi:10.1186/s13326-024-00320-3\n+property_value: IAO:0000233 \"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/9703\" xsd:anyURI\n+\n+[Term]\n+id: MONDO:7770005\n+name: PPOX-related hepatic porphyria\n+def: \"A semidominant hepatic porphyria caused by monoallelic or biallelic variants in the PPOX gene. Monoallelic variants typically cause variegate porphyria, whereas biallelic variants can cause a more severe childhood-onset form of variegate porphyria.\" [https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/9703, https://clinicalgenome.org/affiliation/40097/]\n+subset: clingen {source=\"MONDO:CLINGEN\"}\n+subset: rare\n+is_a: MONDO:0002520 {source=\"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/9703\", source=\"https://clinicalgenome.org/affiliation/40097/\"} ! hepatic porphyria\n+intersection_of: MONDO:0002520 ! hepatic porphyria\n+intersection_of: has_material_basis_in_germline_mutation_in http://identifiers.org/hgnc/9280 ! PPOX\n+relationship: has_material_basis_in_germline_mutation_in http://identifiers.org/hgnc/9280 {source=\"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/9703\", source=\"https://clinicalgenome.org/affiliation/40097/\"} ! PPOX\n+property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator doi:10.1186/s13326-024-00320-3\n+property_value: IAO:0000233 \"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/9703\" xsd:anyURI\n+\n [Term]\n id: MONDO:8000000\n name: infectious discitis\n","exit":0,"description":"Review ontology diff","truncated":false},"title":"Review ontology diff","time":{"start":1778980974474,"end":1778980974480}},"id":"prt_e33876d84001AOlguelV6T6dKh","sessionID":"ses_1cc82e6b8ffeZCRAO8D6mymYrV","messageID":"msg_e33875762001MsVZ2YO84lw8XW"}}
